# A later blend (e.g. all-sandwich: uoq1 in uof2's slot, uqf2 in uf2's) = a new WORK / P_PREFIX / WG_PREFIX / SPECS / INTERNAL_READ here, then gen_s2b.py.
WORK=s2bw
